  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "On the surface,Yeo-un is the perfect college student—popular, flawless, and insanely good at what she does. But underneath that polished exterior, she hides a kinky side that thrives on being treated like a dog during S\u0026M play.\n\nThe only obstacle keeping her from living this double life? Jin-young.\n \nJin-young approaches her and flirts with her saying she looks like a fox, but then she humiliates her, calling her \"pineapple-haired sunbae,\" and takes full advantage of her weakness after an incident.\n\n“That's not what you’re supposed to say to me, sunbae.\" \n“You're a dog, aren’t you? Then bark.”"
  },
